<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>python Utilities on Winner's Dev Notes</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/categories/python-utilities/</link><description>Recent content in python Utilities on Winner's Dev Notes</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://releaseleaf.com/categories/python-utilities/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Write JSON Files Atomically in Python with os.replace</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/pythonatomicjson.html</link><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/pythonatomicjson.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;A game asset pipeline stores its latest successful bundle in &lt;code&gt;manifest.json&lt;/code&gt;. Opening that file for writing immediately truncates the previous manifest. A serialization error or interrupted write can leave the next build with an empty or incomplete document.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Prepare the new JSON separately, write it to a neighboring temporary file, and replace the destination only after that file is ready. This Python 3.8 or later recipe targets small documents, an application-controlled directory, and one writer. It does not require a third-party package.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Run Python Subprocesses with Argument Lists, Checks, and Timeouts</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/pythonsubprocess.html</link><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/pythonsubprocess.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;A game asset pipeline calls a converter with a filename such as &lt;code&gt;level 1 &amp;amp; bonus.json&lt;/code&gt;. The filename should arrive as one argument. If conversion fails or stalls, the pipeline should stop before publishing its output.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Build a small command runner around &lt;code&gt;subprocess.run&lt;/code&gt;. The examples below use Python 3.7 or later on a desktop or build server. They launch the current Python interpreter as a stand-in for a converter, so you can reproduce every case without installing another program.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Hash Large Files with SHA-256 in Python Using Bounded Reads</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/pythonfilehash.html</link><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/pythonfilehash.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;A downloaded game asset bundle needs to match the checksum in its release manifest. Loading the entire bundle with &lt;code&gt;read()&lt;/code&gt; works for a small fixture, but makes memory use grow with the file size.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Feed successive binary chunks into one SHA-256 object instead. This Python 3 implementation uses the standard library, returns a conventional hexadecimal digest, and lets file errors reach the caller.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="hash-bytes-in-order"&gt;Hash Bytes in Order&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#hash-bytes-in-order"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;An incremental hash keeps state between updates. Calling &lt;code&gt;update()&lt;/code&gt; twice hashes the same byte sequence as concatenating those two inputs and hashing once:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Reject Duplicate JSON Keys and Non-Finite Numbers in Python</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/pythonstrictjson.html</link><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/pythonstrictjson.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;A game configuration contains two &lt;code&gt;retries&lt;/code&gt; fields. A reviewer reads the first value, while the application uses the second. Another configuration loads successfully but gives a timeout the value &lt;code&gt;Infinity&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;For a small configuration file, reject these inputs while parsing, before applying defaults or changing application state. This Python 3 example uses only the standard library and keeps the validation policy in one reusable module.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="reproduce-the-permissive-defaults"&gt;Reproduce the Permissive Defaults&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#reproduce-the-permissive-defaults"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The default decoder accepts repeated object names and keeps the last value. It also accepts special numeric tokens:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Read UTF-8 CSV in Python with BOM and Header Validation</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/pythoncsvvalidation.html</link><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/pythoncsvvalidation.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;A CSV export looks correct in a text editor, but an importer cannot find its &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt; column. Another export imports without an error while silently losing a column because two headers share the same name.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Handle these as separate input problems: decode the file correctly, validate its header, and check each record&amp;rsquo;s width before building dictionaries. The following Python 3 utility reads a small, known CSV format using only the standard library.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Find Images Larger Than 500 KB Recursively with python</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/fiimlathkb.html</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 Jul 2024 20:48:47 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/fiimlathkb.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Large images in an exported web project can increase loading time. This script recursively scans a directory and writes paths for images larger than 500 KB to &lt;code&gt;large_images.txt&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1"&gt; 1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-2"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-2"&gt; 2&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-3"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-3"&gt; 3&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-4"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-4"&gt; 4&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-5"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-5"&gt; 5&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-6"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-6"&gt; 6&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-7"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-7"&gt; 7&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-8"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-8"&gt; 8&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-9"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-9"&gt; 9&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-10"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-10"&gt;10&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-11"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-11"&gt;11&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-12"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-12"&gt;12&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-13"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-13"&gt;13&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-14"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-14"&gt;14&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-15"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-15"&gt;15&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-16"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-16"&gt;16&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nn"&gt;os&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;find_large_images&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;directory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;size_limit_kb&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;output_file&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;output_file&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;w&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;encoding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;utf-8&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;output&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;root&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;_&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;files&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="ow"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;os&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;walk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;directory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="ow"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;files&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;path&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;os&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;join&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;root&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;size_kb&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;os&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;getsize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;1024&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;is_image&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;lower&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;endswith&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;((&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;.png&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;.jpg&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;.jpeg&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;.gif&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;.bmp&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;is_image&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="ow"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;size_kb&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;size_limit_kb&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;output&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;write&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;path&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="se"&gt;\n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="vm"&gt;__name__&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;__main__&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;directory&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;input&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;Directory to scan: &amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;find_large_images&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;directory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;large_images.txt&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;Finished. Results were saved to large_images.txt&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Edit HTML with python Beautiful Soup: Insert Scripts, Styles and Markup</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/edhtpybeso.html</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 Jul 2024 20:34:02 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/edhtpybeso.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Manually modifying &lt;code&gt;index.html&lt;/code&gt; after every Cocos Creator web export is repetitive and error-prone. python and Beautiful Soup can automate it.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Install the dependencies:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;pip install beautifulsoup4 lxml&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-1"&gt; 1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-2"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-2"&gt; 2&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-3"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-3"&gt; 3&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-4"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-4"&gt; 4&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-5"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-5"&gt; 5&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-6"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-6"&gt; 6&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-7"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-7"&gt; 7&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-8"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-8"&gt; 8&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-9"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-9"&gt; 9&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-10"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-10"&gt;10&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-11"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-11"&gt;11&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-12"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-12"&gt;12&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-13"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-13"&gt;13&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-14"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-14"&gt;14&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-15"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-15"&gt;15&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-16"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-16"&gt;16&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-17"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-17"&gt;17&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-18"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-18"&gt;18&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-19"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-19"&gt;19&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-20"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-20"&gt;20&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-21"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-21"&gt;21&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-22"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-22"&gt;22&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-23"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-23"&gt;23&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-24"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-24"&gt;24&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-25"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-25"&gt;25&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-26"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-26"&gt;26&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-27"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-27"&gt;27&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-28"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-28"&gt;28&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-29"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-29"&gt;29&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-30"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-30"&gt;30&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-31"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-31"&gt;31&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-32"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-32"&gt;32&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nn"&gt;bs4&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;BeautifulSoup&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;insert_code_in_html&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;file_path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;head_code&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt; &amp;lt;script src=&amp;#34;https://telegram.org/js/telegram-web-app.js&amp;#34;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/script&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt; &amp;lt;style&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt; html, body, #GameDiv, #Cocos3dGameContainer, #GameCanvas {&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt; width: 100%; height: 100%; margin: 0;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt; }&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt; &amp;lt;/style&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt; &amp;#39;&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;body_code&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt; &amp;lt;div id=&amp;#34;loading-animation&amp;#34;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;img src=&amp;#34;web.png&amp;#34; alt=&amp;#34;Loading&amp;#34;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt; &amp;lt;div id=&amp;#34;loading-text&amp;#34;&amp;gt;Loading may take a few seconds. Please be patient.&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt; &amp;lt;script&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt; const tg = window.Telegram.WebApp;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt; tg.isClosingConfirmationEnabled = true;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt; &amp;lt;/script&amp;gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt; &amp;#39;&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;file_path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;r&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;encoding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;utf-8&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;source&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;soup&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;BeautifulSoup&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;source&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;lxml&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;soup&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;head&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;soup&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;head&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;append&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;BeautifulSoup&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;head_code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;html.parser&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;soup&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;soup&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;append&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;BeautifulSoup&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;body_code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;html.parser&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;file_path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;w&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;encoding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;utf-8&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;output&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;output&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;write&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;str&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;soup&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;insert_code_in_html&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;web-mobile/index.html&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Do not name the script &lt;code&gt;html.py&lt;/code&gt;; that shadows python&amp;rsquo;s standard &lt;code&gt;html&lt;/code&gt; package and can cause a circular-import error while importing Beautiful Soup.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>